Typing Speed
------------

The practice passages and the common-word list in the Typing Speed game
(src/components/game/typing-speed/corpus/) come from the public-domain works
below. Every author died before 1926 and every work was published before 1929,
so each is in the public domain in the United States and under life+100 terms.

The passages are short excerpts, normalized to typeable ASCII (curly quotes
straightened, italic markers removed, line breaks joined) and otherwise
verbatim. The word list is derived from word counts across these works; it
contains no running text.

